<section class="problem" id="problem">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Kenalan Dulu</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Pernah merasa <span class="gradient-text">begini?</span></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Kalau salah satu terasa familiar, kamu butuh cara baru.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="problem-card">
        <span class="problem-icon">💸</span>
        <h3 class="problem-title">Uang Habis Misterius</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">Gaji baru masuk tanggal 25, tanggal 5 sudah tipis — kemana aja?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-card">
        <span class="problem-icon">😴</span>
        <h3 class="problem-title">Males Catat Manual</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">Niat catat pengeluaran, tapi buka spreadsheet aja sudah males duluan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-card">
        <span class="problem-icon">😵‍💫</span>
        <h3 class="problem-title">App Keuangan Ribet</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">Sudah download 3 aplikasi keuangan, semuanya terlalu ribet dan akhirnya ditinggal.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-card">
        <span class="problem-icon">🎯</span>
        <h3 class="problem-title">Gagal Nabung Terus</h3>
        <p class="problem-desc">Punya niat nabung tapi selalu gagal konsisten. Akhir bulan selalu bertanya: "Uangku habis ke mana ya?"</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem{padding:80px 0;background:var(--surface)}
  .problem-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px}
  .problem-card{background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px 24px;transition:var(--transition);box-shadow:var(--shadow-bold)}
  .problem-card:hover{transform:translate(-2px,-2px);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--ink)}
  .problem-icon{font-size:32px;display:block;margin-bottom:12px}
  .problem-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--text)}
  .problem-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-weight:600}
  @media(max-width:768px){.problem-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
